 /// bytes (e.g. 256 KiB for a 1 GiB configuration). A `u8` is sufficient because at
 /// most [`config::kernel::MAX_PROCESSES`] (≤ 255) processes can simultaneously share a
 /// frame, so the refcount of any frame is bounded by 255.
 ///
 /// # Safety
